          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Firstly, scholarships reduce tuition costs. Secondly, they improve visa approval chances by demonstrating financial stability. Moreover, many scholarships offer living allowances, travel grants, and health insurance support. As a result, students can focus more on academics and career growth."
