          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "2. Are fully funded scholarships available in 2026?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9776f3e1ec7b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a9ceedfcd031",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, many countries and universities continue to offer fully funded scholarships covering tuition and living expenses."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2c1a9a05375f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5f5a006db8b4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "3. Can international students get scholarships without IELTS?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4bd9f077ddf5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "af68d0c1fefa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Some scholarships may waive IELTS if students meet alternative English proficiency requirements or prior education criteria."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e13ff0a758c2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6f7f26a0eefd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "4. When should I apply for scholarships for 2026 intake?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d6875fdfe8f7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ee46999a9eb2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It is recommended to start applying 8–12 months before the intake to meet deadlines."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d6c43825a271",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "59b306527460",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "5. Do scholarships increase visa approval chances?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c17253dd35af",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "492f9df17399",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, scholarships demonstrate financial stability and academic merit, which can positively impact visa decisions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8ff11ffc4d40",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4a3171bd7ac6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "6. Are scholarships available for undergraduate students?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e60165c5a1ab",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aa2cfe60295b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, scholarships are available for undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programs."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "214f87b79d38",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6758ebe8eec6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "7. Can I apply for multiple scholarships at the same time?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0cb7e469977c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "98b68dc235b7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, students can apply for multiple scholarships, but acceptance terms may vary."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f279e984312a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4aa22cf5b7c0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "8. What documents are required for scholarship applications?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0c63f1586e2b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ae23de57363c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Common documents include academic transcripts, SOP, recommendation letters, financial proof, and test scores."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7eca103ecb79",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4f43c2eede96",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "9. Do scholarships cover living expenses in 2026?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4f3d9a4feeb5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "24b7863d3313",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Many government and fully funded scholarships include monthly living allowances."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "91065d571b70",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4dbf51473a4d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
